### Ingest a single event
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/events/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-00132",
  "timestamp": "2026-05-20T14:32:10Z",
  "configId": 14227,
  "policyId": "pol_web1",
  "clientIp": "203.0.113.42",
  "hostname": "www.example.com",
  "path": "/api/v1/login",
  "method": "POST",
  "statusCode": 403,
  "userAgent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)",
  "rule": {
    "id": "950001",
    "name": "SQL_INJECTION",
    "message": "SQL Injection Attack Detected",
    "severity": "CRITICAL",
    "category": "INJECTION"
  },
  "action": "DENY",
  "geoLocation": { "country": "CN", "city": "Beijing" },
  "requestSize": 1024,
  "responseSize": 256
}

### Ingest a batch of events
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/events/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "eventId": "evt-batch-1",
    "timestamp": "2026-05-20T14:35:00Z",
    "configId": 14227,
    "clientIp": "198.51.100.17",
    "hostname": "api.example.com",
    "path": "/search",
    "method": "GET",
    "statusCode": 200,
    "rule": {
      "id": "941100", "name": "XSS_ATTACK",
      "severity": "HIGH", "category": "XSS"
    },
    "action": "ALERT"
  },
  {
    "eventId": "evt-batch-2",
    "timestamp": "2026-05-20T14:35:05Z",
    "configId": 14227,
    "clientIp": "192.0.2.5",
    "hostname": "www.example.com",
    "path": "/robots.txt",
    "method": "GET",
    "statusCode": 200,
    "rule": {
      "id": "913001", "name": "BOT_ACTIVITY",
      "severity": "LOW", "category": "BOT"
    },
    "action": "MONITOR"
  }
]

### Stats summary (unfiltered — aggregates across all configurations)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/stats/summary

### Stats summary (filtered by configId and time range)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/stats/summary?configId=14227&from=2026-05-20T14:00:00Z&to=2026-05-20T15:00:00Z

### Samples — top 20 newest, unfiltered
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/events/samples?limit=20

### Samples — filtered by category and paginated
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/events/samples?category=INJECTION&limit=10&offset=0

### Actuator health probe
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
